{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124334","id":4805064072,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHmd1iA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124334","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124334.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124334.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124334","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124334/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124334/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124334/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/20bfa37841ad8c44f3f316c0d7957f8961fdba05","number":124334,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix out-of-bounds draw pass errors when exporting with the shader baker","user":{"login":"Aureliolo","id":19254254,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU0MjU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19254254?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aureliolo","html_url":"https://github.com/Aureliolo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aureliolo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aureliolo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aureliolo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aureliolo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aureliolo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aureliolo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aureliolo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aureliolo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aureliolo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\nExporting a project with the shader baker enabled (`shader_baker/enabled=true`, exported with a window, since the baker does not run headless) prints these errors for every `GPUParticles3D` that has fewer than four draw passes:\n\n```\nERROR: Index p_pass = 1 is out of bounds (draw_passes.size() = 1).\n   at: get_draw_pass_mesh (scene/3d/gpu_particles_3d.cpp:309)\nERROR: Index p_pass = 2 is out of bounds (draw_passes.size() = 1).\nERROR: Index p_pass = 3 is out of bounds (draw_passes.size() = 1).\n```\n\nReproducible in 4.5.stable, 4.7.1.stable, 4.7.2.stable and master (2bbcb4960e). \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n1. New project with the Mobile or Forward+ renderer.\n2. Add a `GPUParticles3D` with a `ParticleProcessMaterial` and a `QuadMesh` in `draw_pass_1` (leave `draw_passes` at 1), save the scene.\n3. Add a Windows export preset and enable \"Shader Baker\".\n4. Export from the editor (not `--headless`).\n\nMRP:  [godot-mrp-baker-particles.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33264874/godot-mrp-baker-particles.zip)\nIt already has both presets: \"Windows Desktop\" (baker on) shows the errors, \"Windows Desktop no baker\" exports cleanly.\n\n## Additional information\n`EditorExportPlatform::_export_customize_object` walks `get_property_list()` and calls `get()` on every `OBJECT` property without checking its usage. `GPUParticles3D` hides `draw_pass_2` to `draw_pass_4` when `draw_passes` is lower, but they stay in the list, so the walk reads them and `get_draw_pass_mesh` fails its bounds check. This only shows with the baker because it is the export plugin that makes the export customize objects.\n\nThe fix skips properties without `PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE`. Those are never written to the exported resource, so customizing them could not change the export; the only difference is that they are no longer read.\n\nThe same errors were mentioned in a review comment on the shader baker PR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102552#discussion_r2100528501\n\nTested on Windows with editor builds of master with and without the change:\n- MRP with the baker: 3 errors before, none after. Without the baker: none either way.\n- A full game (6,162 files), Windows and Linux presets: 54 errors before, none after.\n- The exported packs contain the same files; the only byte differences are in `.scn` files that also differ between two exports of unmodified master.\n- `--test` gives the same result on both builds.\n\nAI disclosure: I Claude code (opus) to trace the cause and suggest the fix, and to run the builds and tests above. I reviewed the change and the results.","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-09T19:40:36Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T21:35:29Z","closed_at":"2026-10-09T19:49:44Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"8eafb097b0b8958a38cf9bfca46beabda39f9547","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Aureliolo:export-customize-storage-only","ref":"export-customize-storage-only","repo":null,"sha":"20bfa37841ad8c44f3f316c0d7957f8961fdba05","user":{"login":"Aureliolo","id":19254254,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU0MjU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19254254?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aureliolo","html_url":"https://github.com/Aureliolo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aureliolo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aureliolo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aureliolo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aureliolo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aureliolo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aureliolo/orgs","r